# Journey — Agent Documentation Protocol

**Before any work:** Read `docs/PROJECT_STATUS.md`.

**After any work:** Update:

- `docs/PROJECT_STATUS.md` (status, changelog, next steps)
- `docs/PROJECT_REFERENCE.md` (full project reference for Gemini/collaborators)
- **`README.md`** when you add, remove, or materially change **user-visible** features (writing tools, AI actions, settings, export/backup, shortcuts, platforms, install/releases)

Also update `docs/ROADMAP.md` when completing phase items.

**Versioning:** Keep `pubspec.yaml` at `1.0.0+<build>` — only increment the build number after `+`, never the `1.0.0` unless the user asks.

See `AGENTS.md` at repo root for full instructions.
